+#!/usr/bin/env bash
+set +e
+
+if (( $# < 2 )); then
+  printf 'usage: %s LOG COMMAND [ARG ...]\n' "$0" >&2
+  exit 2
+fi
+
+audit_log=$1
+shift
+
+{
+  printf 'COMMAND:'
+  printf ' %q' "$@"
+  printf '\n'
+  "$@"
+  audit_status=$?
+  printf '\nEXIT_STATUS: %d\n' "$audit_status"
+} >"$audit_log" 2>&1
+
+exit "$audit_status"

REVIEW.md and all reviewer-authored evidence are complete. The report ends with the required FAIL / NOT_LEGIT markers and documents clean #Top reconstruction, non-vacuity, pinning failure, and false-conclusion witnesses for both unsound loop bridges.
